<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8" />

<meta
  name="viewport"
  content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
/>

<title>Thank You | Travaza</title>

<meta
  name="robots"
  content="noindex"
/>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />

<link
  rel="preconnect"
  href="https://fonts.gstatic.com"
  crossorigin
/>

<link
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300&family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap"
  rel="stylesheet"
/>

<style>

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;

  min-height: 100vh;

  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  background: #050505;
  color: #ffffff;

  font-family: "Manrope", Arial, sans-serif;
}

.page {
  width: min(900px, calc(100% - 40px));

  text-align: center;

  padding: 80px 20px;
}

.logo {
  width: 190px;

  margin: 0 auto 75px;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: #e6c57d;

  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;

  letter-spacing: .22em;

  text-transform: uppercase;
}

h1 {
  margin: 22px 0;

  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;

  font-size: clamp(65px, 9vw, 115px);

  line-height: .88;

  font-weight: 300;

  letter-spacing: -.04em;
}

h1 span {
  color: #e6c57d;
  font-style: italic;
}

p {
  max-width: 620px;

  margin: 30px auto;

  color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);

  font-size: 16px;

  line-height: 1.8;
}

.button {
  display: inline-flex;

  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  min-height: 55px;

  margin-top: 20px;

  padding: 0 28px;

  background: #c89a3d;
  color: #080808;

  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;

  letter-spacing: .17em;

  text-transform: uppercase;

  text-decoration: none;
}

.contact {
  margin-top: 70px;

  padding-top: 30px;

  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);

  color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);

  font-size: 11px;
}

.contact a {
  color: #e6c57d;
  text-decoration: none;
}

</style>

</head>


<body>

<main class="page">

<a href="/">

<img
  class="logo"
  src="/images/travaza/travaza-gold.png"
  alt="Travaza"
/>

</a>


<div class="eyebrow">
YOUR JOURNEY STARTS HERE
</div>


<h1>

Thank you.

<br />

<span>We'll take it from here.</span>

</h1>


<p>

Your request has been received by Travaza.

A member of our team will review the details of your journey
and connect with you to begin creating your experience.

</p>


<a
  href="/"
  class="button"
>
Return to Travaza
</a>


<div class="contact">

PRIVATE TRAVEL • CURATED EXPERIENCES • GLOBAL MOVEMENT

<br /><br />

<a href="mailto:reservations@travaza.com">
reservations@travaza.com
</a>

</div>

</main>

</body>

</html>
